  "result": "When an invitation is accepted, `acceptInvitation` in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts` emits `member.joined`. Two files subscribe to that event:\n\n- `src/server/services/usage-service.ts` (`registerUsageListeners`, line 89) imports `organization-repository` and `usage-repository`.\n- `src/server/services/notification-service.ts` (`registerFanOut`, line 231) imports `issue-repository`, `notification-repository`, `organization-repository` and `notification-preference-repository`.\n\n`organization-repository` is imported by both files, so the union is five distinct repository files. I took \"imported by\" to mean direct imports only. I did not follow the import chains further.\n\nANSWER: src/server/repositories/usage-repository.ts, src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-repository.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts, src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts",
